  "text": "The FDF features a perpetual $100 million annual funding flow, supported by a sovereign wealth investment approach. It emphasizes integrated delivery through Innovation Hubs, strong alignment with the National Drought Agreement, and a focus on building social capital. The fund also includes interoperable climate services and self-assessment tools, with oversight provided by an independent Productivity Commission review cycle.",
